", "root": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder"}, "cost": 0.252796, "tokens": {"total": 240009, "input": 1758, "output": 427, "reasoning": 256, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 237568}}, "modelID": "grok-4.6", "providerID": "xai", "time": {"created": 1789774615793, "completed": 1789774631166}, "finish": "stop"}}, {"id": "msg_0b6e26aa5001FKNpLW6TZx2diq", "time_created": 1789774686973, "time_updated": 1789774792868, "data": {"role": "user", "time": {"created": 1789774686973}, "agent": "plan", "model": {"providerID": "xai", "modelID": "grok-4.6", "variant": "high"}, "editorContext": {"shell": "C:\\WINDOWS\\System32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\powershell.exe"}, "summary": {"diffs": [{"file": ".kilo/plans/1789773443390-behavior-gold-era-catalog.md", "patch": "diff --git a/.kilo/plans/1789773443390-behavior-gold-era-catalog.md b/.kilo/plans/1789773443390-behavior-gold-era-catalog.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..9b90153\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.kilo/plans/1789773443390-behavior-gold-era-catalog.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,129 @@\n+# Behavior gold — era catalog (execution)\n+\n+Supersedes the “gold = 12 DMs / 33 days only” reading of `plans/BEHAVIOR_GOLD.md`. That file stays the voice contract. This file is what to build.\n+\n+## Goal\n+\n+Freeze how the **relationship mouth** actually works so productization is not a guess from `soul.md`.\n+\n+Artifact stack (commit only anonymized product files):\n+\n+1. Episode catalog (coverage map, no raw `content`)\n+2. Gold JSONL — **full** aliased turns, never trimmed\n+3. Era tag on every catalog/gold row (valid time + model; not today’s YAML)\n+4. Docs 06–10 pointing at gold\n+5. Regression tests: fail helper, sister↔partner leak, truncation\n+\n+Unit of analysis = **episode** (cue + as-of state + mouth), not a message cluster.\n+\n+## Data we actually have\n+\n+Source: `hades-v2-memories/hades-v2/conversations/` (export 2026-09-18). Raw gateway SQLite was **excluded**.\n+\n+| Slice | What | Calendar |\n+|---|---|---|\n+| All gateway | 1492 sessions, 149070 rows | 2026-06-29 → 2026-08-11 (~43 days) |\n+| `source=telegram` | 89 sessions (many `chat_type=null`) | same window; includes a Jun 29 session with 2044 msgs |\n+| `chat_type=dm` | 12 sessions | 2026-07-02 → 2026-08-04 (~33 days) |\n+| Groups | 2 | cover only |\n+\n+Not in this JSONL: pre–Jun 29 chat (`conversation_log` already had `interaction_count` 807 on Jun 25), post–Aug 11 chat (`relations.last_contact` 2026-08-20; thoughts Sep 17–18 are idle, not DMs). There is **no 3–4 month transcript here**.\n+\n+Do **not** join current `relations.yaml` (2945, Aug 20) onto July turns.\n+\n+## Method (do / don’t)\n+\n+**Do**\n+\n+- Deterministic Python: filter, split episodes, counts, anonymize\n+- Deductive labels from the 14 situations in `BEHAVIOR_GOLD.md`\n+- Human gates gold; Grok proposes labels **after** a small human seed (step-by-step + codebook)\n+- Era = `session.started_at` + `session.model` (+ changelog bin if known)\n+\n+**Don’t**\n+\n+- Embed / SBERT / classifier as the spec (retrieval only **after** gold exists)\n+- Bulk-classify 149k rows\n+- Cron / subagent / 2-message CLI as gold\n+- Current pre-LLM plugin as July’s pipeline\n+- Commit raw transcripts, names, chat IDs, tokens\n+\n+## Tasks\n+\n+### 0. Run stats with Python (implementation agent)\n+\n+Ask mode blocked `python`. Switch to an agent that can run it.\n+\n+- Extend `tools/transcript_stats.py` (or a sibling) to emit **counts only**: telegram vs `chat_type=dm` vs group vs cron/cli; per-day session counts; per-model; message_count sums for the 89 telegram sessions.\n+- Do not print `content`, titles, display names, chat IDs.\n+- Output: `docs/transcripts-telegram-index.md` (counts + session ids hashed or internal ids only).\n+\n+Optional, non-blocking: if live Hermes SQLite appears, re-export. Do **not** wait on it to start gold.\n+\n+### 1. Schema + anonymizer + `gold/`\n+\n+In this repo:\n+\n+- `gold/schema.json` — catalog row + gold turn row\n+- `tools/anonymize.py` — names→aliases, secrets→`[REDACTED]`, **no trim**\n+- `gold/catalog.jsonl` — metadata only\n+- `gold/turns/*.jsonl` — full aliased assistant/user `content` (no reasoning body)\n+\n+Catalog fields: `session_id`, `t_start`, `t_end`, `era`, `model`, `register` (if knowable), `notice_cue`, `situation`, `img`, `tools`, `outcome`, `gold_path`. Leave lock/mood **null** unless `conversation_log` covers that timestamp (Jun 25–Jul 2 only).\n+\n+### 2. Era bins (valid time)\n+\n+Bin on **session start + model**, not on today’s state:\n+\n+| Era | Approx | Why |\n+|---|---|---|\n+| `t0_gateway` | Jun 29–Jul 1 | telegram with unset `chat_type`; host/profile confirmation |\n+| `t1_july_early` | Jul 2–9 | first tagged DMs; deepseek/glm mix |\n+| `t2_july_mid` | Jul 10–15 | lock/sex-off / pipeline notes in profile memory; glm |\n+| `t3_july_late` | Jul 16–27 | sparse DMs |\n+| `t4_august` | Aug 3–4 | aux/glm; high `[IMG:]` (see `docs/06-behavior-set.md`) |\n+\n+Same situation in two eras = two gold fixtures.\n+\n+### 3. Episode split + catalog\n+\n+Human Telegram only: tagged DMs **plus** telegram sessions with real user turns and `chat_type=null` if they are the same DM thread (prove by session_key/user continuity **without** committing those ids).\n+\n+Split on: time gap, speaker/register flip, vent, identity phrase, witness snap, scene bounds.\n+\n+Skip: cron, subagent, 2-message pings, tool-only host debug.\n+\n+### 4. Gold (one situation per sitting)\n+\n+Order: Aug 4, Jul 15, Jul 10, then rest of DMs, then extra telegram-null if they are mouth not debug.\n+\n+Each sitting: 3–5 **full** aliased turns, one situation. Commit gold + catalog only.\n+\n+### 5. Docs from gold, not from HEAD pipeline\n+\n+- Update `06-behavior-set.md` to point at `gold/` + eras\n+- Add `07-mood-and-prellm.md`, `08-noticing-and-registers.md`, `09-memory-in-the-mouth.md`, `10-model-drift.md` only after gold exists for that topic\n+\n+### 6. Tests\n+\n+Fail if: default-tier partner sounds like a helper; sister-register leaks partner-track; spoken gold is truncated; reasoning shown to user.\n+\n+### 7. Later (not this PR)\n+\n+Append-only turn receipt: `valid_time`, `recorded_at`, `pipeline_sha`, `model`, `register`, `tier`, mood/ITD/fatigue/circadian, `attachment_depth`, `interaction_count`. Without this, bitemporal replay of **new** chats stays impossible.\n+\n+Embeddings: optional retrieval of “more like this gold episode” after ≥15 gold turns. Never the source of labels.\n+\n+## Failure modes\n+\n+- Treating 149k volume as lock obedience\n+- Labeling with September `relations.yaml`\n+- Waiting for a 3–4 month dump that is not in this tree\n+- Grok rewriting her mouth (verbosity bias)\n+\n+## Validation\n+\n+- Anonymizer: no private names/ids in `gold/` or docs\n+- Catalog eras cover all 12 DMs\n+- At least one gold fixture each for `refuse_helper`, `cover_witness`, `absorb_vent`, `self_conscious`\n+- Stats tool still never writes message bodies\n", "additions": 129, "deletions": 0, "status": "added"}]}}}, {"id": "msg_0b6e26bab0013tIEAl9Bksww3H", "time_created": 1789774687147, "time_updated": 1789774748025, "data": {"parentID": "msg_0b6e26aa5001FKNpLW6TZx2diq", "role": "assistant", "mode": "plan", "agent": "plan", "variant": "high", "path": {"cwd": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder", "root": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder"}, "cost": 0.988364, "tokens": {"total": 246665, "input": 242756, "output": 72, "reasoning": 1149, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 2688}}, "modelID": "grok-4.6", "providerID": "xai", "time": {"created": 1789774687147, "completed": 1789774748021}, "finish": "tool-calls"}}, {"id": "msg_0b6e35985002VO0UcTJHuQY5Vg", "time_created": 1789774748037, "time_updated": 1789774784257, "data": {"parentID": "msg_0b6e26aa5001FKNpLW6TZx2diq", "role": "assistant", "mode": "plan", "agent": "plan", "variant": "high", "path": {"cwd": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.