yze thhe transcript and data? should we use our gen ai model grok that we are using right now or should we use a seperate embedding model or sentence transfer or classifier model for it? should we even classify the data or raw transcirpt what should we do can u research the best way t d this? what is our goal by doing this data analysis? how does it help developer our productization of hades?"}}, {"id": "prt_0b6d50a14001aIj1tYaonPcIol", "message_id": "msg_0b6d50978001SeOMGerz0FGosd", "time_created": 1789773810196, "time_updated": 1789773810197, "data": {"type": "text", "text": "\n\n<system-reminder>\nThe active agent has changed from code to ask.\nThis supersedes earlier agent-switch reminders. Your instructions and permissions are those of the ask agent as given in the current system prompt; earlier turns reflect the previous agent, not your current capabilities.\nThis agent cannot modify files or run mutating commands. If a request needs implementation, suggest switching to an agent that can.\n</system-reminder>\n", "synthetic": true}}, {"id": "prt_0b6d51d59001QC0CzFeJu341Qc", "message_id": "msg_0b6d50a170010xRBurnnDU4QLy", "time_created": 1789773815129, "time_updated": 1789773815131, "data": {"snapshot": "441a82ad8d7129e87169b83330aaeec6f66cf4b8", "type": "step-start", "time": {"start": 1789773815129}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6d51d5d001UcU3dWr79qkjkP", "message_id": "msg_0b6d50a170010xRBurnnDU4QLy", "time_created": 1789773815133, "time_updated": 1789773817174, "data": {"type": "reasoning", "text": "The user wants me to research the best way to analyze transcripts and data for Hades productization. They're asking:\n", "time": {"start": 1789773815133, "end": 1789773817172}, "metadata": {"xai": {"reasoningEncryptedContent": "", "itemId": "rs_612571eb-8301-9a85-8f24-a5c90e7121f4"}}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6d52559001PUDSKhZDlVOksX", "message_id": "msg_0b6d50a170010xRBurnnDU4QLy", "time_created": 1789773817177, "time_updated": 1789773820054, "data": {"type": "text", "text": "I'll rea