t Week Past Month Past Year\n\n## [Assessing the Potential and Limits of Large Language Models in ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.researchgate.net%2Fpublication%2F383416457_Assessing_the_Potential_and_Limits_of_Large_Language_Models_in_Qualitative_Coding&rut=ffb39e89849ee7ae9ce40dade0921a6ae55869f833902c314484c974e27c37f6)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/www.researchgate.net.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.researchgate.net%2Fpublication%2F383416457_Assessing_the_Potential_and_Limits_of_Large_Language_Models_in_Qualitative_Coding&rut=ffb39e89849ee7ae9ce40dade0921a6ae55869f833902c314484c974e27c37f6)[www.researchgate.net/publication/383416457\\_Assessing\\_the\\_Potential\\_and\\_Limits\\_of\\_Large\\_Language\\_Models\\_in\\_Qualitative\\_Coding](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.researchgate.net%2Fpublication%2F383416457_Assessing_the_Potential_and_Limits_of_Large_Language_Models_in_Qualitative_Coding&rut=ffb39e89849ee7ae9ce40dade0921a6ae55869f833902c314484c974e27c37f6)     2024-11-03T00:00:00.0000000\n\n[This study investigates the potential of LLMs like ChatGPT for **qualitative** data analysis, focusing on open, axial, selective **coding**, theme or pattern identification, and inter-rater **reliability**.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.researchgate.net%2Fpublication%2F383416457_Assessing_the_Potential_and_Limits_of_Large_Language_Models_in_Qualitative_Coding&rut=ffb39e89849ee7ae9ce40dade0921a6ae55869f833902c314484c974e27c37f6)\n\n## [Assessing the Reliability of Large Language Models for Deductive ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fasistdl.onlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1002%2Fpra2.1255&rut=59d1fd9ef44772e7facd2773fd6f84f7127d7246b56557392468ff22cd13bffb)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/asistdl.onlinelibrary.wiley.com.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fasistdl.onlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1002%2Fpra2.1255&rut=59d1fd9ef44772e7facd2773fd6f84f7127d7246b56557392468ff22cd13bffb)[asistdl.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/pra2.1255](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fasistdl.onlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1002%2Fpra2.1255&rut=59d1fd9ef44772e7facd2773fd6f84f7127d7246b56557392468ff22cd13bffb)     2025-10-16T00:00:00.0000000\n\n[ABSTRACT In this study we investigate the use of **large** **language** **models** (LLMs), specifically ChatGPT, for structured deductive **qualitative** **coding**. While most current research emphasizes inductive **coding** applications, we address the underexplored potential of LLMs to perform deductive classification tasks aligned with established human-coded schemes.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fasistdl.onlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1002%2Fpra2.1255&rut=59d1fd9ef44772e7facd2773fd6f84f7127d7246b56557392468ff22cd13bffb)\n\n## [Assessing the Potential and Limits of Large Language Models in ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flink.springer.com%2Fchapter%2F10.1007%2F978%2D3%2D031%2D76335%2D9_7&rut=4dfc778e460adeb72fe5ec7ef9ae289b467aa506108ee32e059a1136d786ef68)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/link.springer.com.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flink.springer.com%2Fchapter%2F10.1007%2F978%2D3%2D031%2D76335%2D9_7&rut=4dfc778e460adeb72fe5ec7ef9ae289b467aa506108ee32e059a1136d786ef68)[link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-76335-9\\_7](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flink.springer.com%2Fchapter%2F10.1007%2F978%2D3%2D031%2D76335%2D9_7&rut=4dfc778e460adeb72fe5ec7ef9ae289b467aa506108ee32e059a1136d786ef68)     2024-11-02T00:00:00.0000000\n\n[This paper examines the advantages and limitations of conducting automated **coding** of virtual tutoring session **transcripts** using the GPT-4 Turbo **model** via the OpenAI API. We compare three **coding** methods: (1) zero-shot, which relies solely on construct definitions; (2) few-shot, which includes annotated examples; and (3) **coding** with context, which provides GPT-4 with surrounding dialogue and ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flink.springer.com%2Fchapter%2F10.1007%2F978%2D3%2D031%2D76335%2D9_7&rut=4dfc778e460adeb72fe5ec7ef9ae289b467aa506108ee32e059a1136d786ef68)\n\n## [Assessing the Reliability of Large Language Models for Deductive ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fpdf%2F2507.14384&rut=63b295a9fa2a3a5037fed388168d7cd448eb7d2c96144baf19c7ef212498e6f7)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/arxiv.org.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fpdf%2F2507.14384&rut=63b295a9fa2a3a5037fed388168d7cd448eb7d2c96144baf19c7ef212498e6f7)[arxiv.org/pdf/2507.14384](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fpdf%2F2507.14384&rut=63b295a9fa2a3a5037fed388168d7cd448eb7d2c96144baf19c7ef212498e6f7)\n\n[In this study, we investigate the use of **large** **language** **models** (LLMs), specifically ChatGPT, for structured deductive **qualitative** **coding**. While most current research emphasizes inductive **coding** applications, we address the underexplored potential of LLMs to perform deductive classification tasks aligned with established human-coded schemes.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fpdf%2F2507.14384&rut=63b295a9fa2a3a5037fed388168d7cd448eb7d2c96144baf19c7ef212498e6f7)\n\n## [\"Conversing\" With Qualitative Data: Enhancing Qualitative Research ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F16094069251322346&rut=9073b25805e9388dab7e6e8b87df2089fd635bb32f070118ae9f7a1f67754cf2)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/journals.sagepub.com.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F16094069251322346&rut=9073b25805e9388dab7e6e8b87df2089fd635bb32f070118ae9f7a1f67754cf2)[journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.1177/16094069251322346](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F16094069251322346&rut=9073b25805e9388dab7e6e8b87df2089fd635bb32f070118ae9f7a1f67754cf2)     2025-02-20T00:00:00.0000000\n\n[**Large** **Language** **Models** (LLMs) are revolutionizing how **qualitative** researchers can work with textual data. Rather than relying only on codebooks or manual line-by-line analysis, scholars can \"converse\" with their materials by asking targeted questions, probing for contextual insights, and refining theoretical connections. This dialogue-like process speeds up traditional tasks—transcription ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F16094069251322346&rut=9073b25805e9388dab7e6e8b87df2089fd635bb32f070118ae9f7a1f67754cf2)\n\n## [Qualitative Coding with GPT-4 | Journal of Learning Analytics](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flearning%2Danalytics.info%2Findex.php%2FJLA%2Farticle%2Fview%2F8575&rut=6a0977a7aca4aab103d03752e29d4e8ac432ef81d9deb5c4b5ec76f8ce6543df)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/learning-analytics.info.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flearning%2Danalytics.info%2Findex.php%2FJLA%2Farticle%2Fview%2F8575&rut=6a0977a7aca4aab103d03752e29d4e8ac432ef81d9deb5c4b5ec76f8ce6543df)[learning-analytics.info/index.php/JLA/article/view/8575](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flearning%2Danalytics.info%2Findex.php%2FJLA%2Farticle%2Fview%2F8575&rut=6a0977a7aca4aab103d03752e29d4e8ac432ef81d9deb5c4b5ec76f8ce6543df)     2025-03-17T00:00:00.0000000\n\n[**qualitative** **coding**, GPT-4, **large** **language** **model**, quantitative ethnography, automated **coding**, research paper Abstract This study explores the potential of the **large** **language** **model** GPT-4 as an automated tool for **qualitative** data analysis by educational researchers, exploring which techniques are most successful for different types of constructs.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Flearning%2Danalytics.info%2Findex.php%2FJLA%2Farticle%2Fview%2F8575&rut=6a0977a7aca4aab103d03752e29d4e8ac432ef81d9deb5c4b5ec76f8ce6543df)\n\n## [Exploring Inductive and Deductive Qualitative Coding With AI ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fopenaccess%2Dapi.cms%2Dconferences.org%2Farticles%2Fdownload%2F978%2D1%2D964867%2D71%2D7_14&rut=5da43d22200ecc3e1d39241b6744dccfbf96d00043946723db67d1b95ded4984)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/openaccess-api.cms-conferences.org.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fopenaccess%2Dapi.cms%2Dconferences.org%2Farticles%2Fdownload%2F978%2D1%2D964867%2D71%2D7_14&rut=5da43d22200ecc3e1d39241b6744dccfbf96d00043946723db67d1b95ded4984)[openaccess-api.cms-conferences.org/articles/download/978-1-964867-71-7\\_14](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fopenaccess%2Dapi.cms%2Dconferences.org%2Farticles%2Fdownload%2F978%2D1%2D964867%2D71%2D7_14&rut=5da43d22200ecc3e1d39241b6744dccfbf96d00043946723db67d1b95ded4984)\n\n[The advent of **Large** **Language** **Models** (LLMs) has introduced new opportunities to streamline **qualitative** analysis. This study investigates the application of LLMs in both inductive and deductive **coding** tasks using real-world datasets, assessing their ability to complement traditional **coding** methods.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fopenaccess%2Dapi.cms%2Dconferences.org%2Farticles%2Fdownload%2F978%2D1%2D964867%2D71%2D7_14&rut=5da43d22200ecc3e1d39241b6744dccfbf96d00043946723db67d1b95ded4984)\n\n## [PDF 185. https://doi.org/10.18608/jla.2025.8575 Qualitative Coding with GPT ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ffiles.eric.ed.gov%2Ffulltext%2FEJ1465623.pdf&rut=d2cf1b6ef9536529dede5a05d95a35bc2b48a390a89eccd7edaa4cc65f217a05)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/files.eric.ed.gov.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ffiles.eric.ed.gov%2Ffulltext%2FEJ1465623.pdf&rut=d2cf1b6ef9536529dede5a05d95a35bc2b48a390a89eccd7edaa4cc65f217a05)[files.eric.ed.gov/fulltext/EJ1465623.pdf](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ffiles.eric.ed.gov%2Ffulltext%2FEJ1465623.pdf&rut=d2cf1b6ef9536529dede5a05d95a35bc2b48a390a89eccd7edaa4cc65f217a05)\n\n[With the advent of **large** **language** **models** (LLM), a rapidly increasing number of studies both within and outside of the learning analytics community are exploring the use of these **models** for **qualitative** **coding** (e.g., Tai et al., **2024**; Zambrano et al., 2023; Kirsten et al., **2024**; Chew et al., 2023; Xiao et al., 2023; Hutt et al., **2024**). **Qualitative** data **coding** using LLMs potentially offers a more ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ffiles.eric.ed.gov%2Ffulltext%2FEJ1465623.pdf&rut=d2cf1b6ef9536529dede5a05d95a35bc2b48a390a89eccd7edaa4cc65f217a05)\n\n## [Updating \"The Future of Coding\": Qualitative Coding with Generative ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F00491241251339188&rut=f0e72434eddd5b33965867b96e37b8bd0a745bbc274df2fbe9895c2a9e3e58af)\n\n [![](//external-content.duckduckgo.com/ip3/journals.sagepub.com.ico)](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F00491241251339188&rut=f0e72434eddd5b33965867b96e37b8bd0a745bbc274df2fbe9895c2a9e3e58af)[journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.1177/00491241251339188](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F00491241251339188&rut=f0e72434eddd5b33965867b96e37b8bd0a745bbc274df2fbe9895c2a9e3e58af)     2025-05-21T00:00:00.0000000\n\n[Over the past decade, social scientists have adapted computational methods for **qualitative** text analysis, with the hope that they can match the accuracy and **reliability** of hand **coding**. The emergence of GPT and open-source generative **large** **language** **models** (LLMs) has transformed this process by shifting from programming to engaging with **models** using natural **language**, potentially mimicking the in ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.sagepub.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1177%2F00491241251339188&rut=f0e72434eddd5b33965867b96e37b8bd0a745bbc274df2fbe9895c2a9e3e58af)\n\n## [PDF Borse\\_PERC25\\_Poster - per-central.org](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=http