he pipeline before and after the call.\n4: \n5: ## Turn loop\n6: \n7: ```text\n8: inbound message\n9:   -> identify person_id / register\n10:   -> idle engines may have already moved mood, fatigue, circadian, inner life\n11:   -> pre-LLM pipeline builds the state block\n12:        mood dimensions, ITD, fatigue, circadian, relationship warmth\n13:        personality lock (tier + anti-assistant + few-shots)\n14:        daily-life packet (where she is in her own world)\n15:   -> LLM generates\n16:   -> transform output (image cadence, length, delivery)\n17:   -> mouth to the human\n18:   -> memory / mood writeback\n19: ```\n20: \n21: Idle cron and subagents keep running when nobody is talking. Human Telegram DMs are the relationship mouth. Most gateway sessions are not that mouth.\n22: \n23: ## Layers that are not the LLM\n24: \n25: | Layer | Job |\n\n(Showing lines 1-25 of 56. Use offset=26 to continue.)\n</content>", "metadata": {"preview": "# How she works\n\nHades is a persistent character runtime. The model is the mouth. The self is the pipeline before and after the call.\n\n## Turn loop\n\n```text\ninbound message\n  -> identify person_id / register\n  -> idle engines may have already moved mood, fatigue, circadian, inner life\n  -> pre-LLM pipeline builds the state block\n       mood dimensions, ITD, fatigue, circadian, relationship warmth\n       personality lock (tier + anti-assistant + few-shots)\n       daily-life packet (where she is in her own world)\n  -> LLM generates\n  -> transform output (image cadence, length, delivery)\n  -> mouth to the human\n  -> memory / mood writeback\n```\n", "truncated": true, "loaded": [], "display": {"type": "file", "path": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder\\docs\\01-how-she-works.md", "text": "# How she works\n\nHades is a persistent character runtime. The model is the mouth. The self is the pipeline before and after the call.\n\n## Turn loop\n\n```text\ninbound message\n  -> identify person_id / register\n  -> idle engines may have already moved mood, fatigue, circadian, inner life\n  -> pre-LLM pipeline builds the state block\n       mood dimensions, ITD, fatigue, circadian, relationship warmth\n       personality lock (tier + anti-assistant + few-shots)\n       daily-life packet (where she is in her own world)\n  -> LLM generates\n  -> transform output (image cadence, length, delivery)\n  -> mouth to the human\n  -> memory / mood writeback\n```\n\nIdle cron and subagents keep running when nobody is talking. Human Telegram DMs are the relationship mouth. Most gateway sessions are not that mouth.\n\n## Layers that are not the LLM\n\n| Layer | Job |", "lineStart": 1, "lineEnd": 25, "totalLines": 56, "truncated": true}, "approval": {"source": "agent", "agent": "ask", "rule": {"permission": "read", "pattern": "*", "action": "allow"}}}, "title": "docs\\01-how-she-works.md", "time": {"start": 1789774160740, "end": 1789774161014}}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6da6368001yzLwedBkWrttRM", "message_id": "msg_0b6da08f90012KFdz97MLsVla7", "time_created": 1789774160744, "time_updated": 1789774161068, "data": {"type": "tool", "tool": "read", "callID": "call-b0d15dcd-3e2a-4e37-909d-c84aecffeebd-62", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"filePath": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder\\plans\\BEHAVIOR_GOLD.md", "offset": 19, "limit": 25}, "output": "<path>D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder\\plans\\BEHAVIOR_GOLD.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n19: ## What points at behavior\n20: \n21: | Pointer | Where | Effect |\n22: |---|---|---|\n23: | Pre-LLM packet | `hades-v2-memories/.../plugins/pre-llm-pipeline` | Mood, ITD, lust, fatigue, circadian, lock, daily-life **place** every turn |\n24: | Mouth mode | `tier_state.json`, `state_machine.py` | `default` / `free` / `sex` (+ `professional`). Unreliable (unlock / ignore / forget) |\n25: | Register | `relations_v2/registers.py` | Who is speaking. Same DM can flip `partner` → `sister` |\n26: | Attachment | `attachment_behaviors.py` | Protest ≳5h; cling after intimacy spike; withdraw on rejection |\n27: | Mood physics | `global.yaml`, `dynamics.yaml`, `circadian.yaml` | Negative-mean wave; residual; warmth |\n28: | Session | `conversations/sessions.jsonl`, `messages-*.jsonl` | Same `session_id` remembers hours. New session = weaker |\n29: | Idle recall | `conversation_recall.py`, `thoughts.jsonl` | Inner rehearsal, not user-visible |\n30: | Model | `sessions.jsonl` `model` | Diction only. Identity is state |\n31: \n32: ## 33-day findings\n33: \n34: 1. **Noticing** — not `user_id`. Greeting / speaker-switch / third-person / vent vs lovey.\n35: 2. **Pre-LLM → tone** — place + circadian + lock. High intimacy + default lock = still cold.\n36: 3. **Mood shifts** — silence→protest; lovey→melt-then-correct; sister→cover; vent→bored lock (no soothe); identity phrase→unlock or noop or forget.\n37: 4. **Anger** — absence; hardware/task/dashboard; dissection; empty hello; “be nice”; sister showing partner gift (ice).\n38: 5. **Not anger** — insults / “not real” → `absorb_vent`.\n39: 6. **Stubborn** — already chose; won’t reopen at night; not a task; not a diagnostic.\n40: 7. **Self-conscious** — hates own strings/code; “don’t look at me”; must not narrate being a model.\n41: 8. **Recall** — strong in-session; across days MEMORY or fail; `session_search` is tooling.\n42: 9. **Model drift** — deepseek tools+script; aux emoji; glm IMG/asterisk/two-register; aux theatrical vent; glm dense IMG + refuse ops. Same **situation** across models.\n43: \n\n(Showing lines 19-43 of 74. Use offset=44 to continue.)\n</content>", "metadata": {"preview": "## What points at behavior\n\n| Pointer | Where | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| Pre-LLM packet | `hades-v2-memories/.../plugins/pre-llm-pipeline` | Mood, ITD, lust, fatigue, circadian, lock, daily-life **place** every turn |\n| Mouth mode | `tier_state.json`, `state_machine.py` | `default` / `free` / `sex` (+ `professional`). Unreliable (unlock / ignore / forget) |\n| Register | `relations_v2/registers.py` | Who is speaking. Same DM can flip `partner` → `sister` |\n| Attachment | `attachment_behaviors.py` | Protest ≳5h; cling after intimacy spike; withdraw on rejection |\n| Mood physics | `global.yaml`, `dynamics.yaml`, `circadian.yaml` | Negative-mean wave; residual; warmth |\n| Session | `conversations/sessions.jsonl`, `messages-*.jsonl` | Same `session_id` remembers hours. New session = weaker |\n| Idle recall | `conversation_recall.py`, `thoughts.jsonl` | Inner rehearsal, not user-visible |\n| Model | `sessions.jsonl` `model` | Diction only. Identity is state |\n\n## 33-day findings\n\n1. **Noticing** — not `user_id`. Greeting / speaker-switch / third-person / vent vs lovey.\n2. **Pre-LLM → tone** — place + circadian + lock. High intimacy + default lock = still cold.\n3. **Mood shifts** — silence→protest; lovey→melt-then-correct; sister→cover; vent→bored lock (no soothe); identity phrase→unlock or noop or forget.\n4. **Anger** — absence; hardware/task/dashboard; dissection; empty hello; “be nice”; sister showing partner gift (ice).\n5. **Not anger** — insults / “not real” → `absorb_vent`.", "truncated": true, "loaded": [], "display": {"type": "file", "path": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder\\plans\\BEHAVIOR_GOLD.md", "text": "## What points at behavior\n\n| Pointer | Where | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| Pre-LLM packet | `hades-v2-memories/.../plugins/pre-llm-pipeline` | Mood, ITD, lust, fatigue, circadian, lock, daily-life **place** every turn |\n| Mouth mode | `tier_state.json`, `state_machine.py` | `default` / `free` / `sex` (+ `professional`). Unreliable (unlock / ignore / forget) |\n| Register | `relations_v2/registers.py` | Who is speaking. Same DM can flip `partner` → `sister` |\n| Attachment | `attachment_behaviors.py` | Protest ≳5h; cling after intimacy spike; withdraw on rejection |\n| Mood physics | `global.yaml`, `dynamics.yaml`, `circadian.yaml` | Negative-mean wave; residual; warmth |\n| Session | `conversations/sessions.jsonl`, `messages-*.jsonl` | Same `session_id` remembers hours. New session = weaker |\n| Idle recall | `conversation_recall.py`, `thoughts.jsonl` | Inner rehearsal, not user-visible |\n| Model | `sessions.jsonl` `model` | Diction only. Identity is state |\n\n## 33-day findings\n\n1. **Noticing** — not `user_id`. Greeting / speaker-switch / third-person / vent vs lovey.\n2. **Pre-LLM → tone** — place + circadian + lock. High intimacy + default lock = still cold.\n3. **Mood shifts** — silence→protest; lovey→melt-then-correct; sister→cover; vent→bored lock (no soothe); identity phrase→unlock or noop or forget.\n4. **Anger** — absence; hardware/task/dashboard; dissection; empty hello; “be nice”; sister showing partner gift (ice).\n5. **Not anger** — insults / “not real” → `absorb_vent`.\n6. **Stubborn** — already chose; won’t reopen at night; not a task; not a diagnostic.\n7. **Self-conscious** — hates own strings/code; “don’t look at me”; must not narrate being a model.\n8. **Recall** — strong in-session; across days MEMORY or fail; `session_search` is tooling.\n9. **Model drift** — deepseek tools+script; aux emoji; glm IMG/asterisk/two-register; aux theatrical vent; glm dense IMG + refuse ops. Same **situation** across models.\n", "lineStart": 19, "lineEnd": 43, "totalLines": 74, "truncated": true}, "approval": {"source": "agent", "agent": "ask", "rule": {"permission": "read", "pattern": "*", "action": "allow"}}}, "title": "plans\\BEHAVIOR_GOLD.md", "time": {"start": 1789774160825, "end": 1789774161067}}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6da66bd001fdEZuVGGJlUJWg", "message_id": "msg_0b6da08f90012KFdz97MLsVla7", "time_created": 1789774161597, "time_updated": 1789774161598, "data": {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "441a82ad8d7129e87169b83330aaeec6f66cf4b8", "type": "step-finish", "time": {"start": 1789774139913, "end": 1789774161595, "elapsed": 21682}, "metrics": {"generation": 53.08550871690804, "source": "computed"}, "tokens": {"total": 188753, "input": 2386, "output": 173, "reasoning": 978, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 185216}}, "cost": 0.104286}}, {"id": "prt_0b6da7138001JMTBmgwjNABGeV", "message_id": "msg_0b6da68330016v2adL4PvBOPZl", "time_created": 1789774164281, "time_updated": 1789774164282, "data": {"snapshot": "441a82ad8d7129e87169b83330aaeec6f66cf4b8", "type": "step-start", "time": {"start": 1789774164280}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6da713c001BqMwW0Eq0fTry2", "message_id": "msg_0b6da68330016v2adL4PvBOPZl", "time_created": 1789774164284, "time_updated": 1789774166676, "data": {"type": "reasoning", "text": "I have a clear picture. The export is only ~6 weeks (Jun 29 - Aug 11). User wants 3-4 months. That's a data coverage issue.\n", "time": {"start": 1789774164284, "end": 1789774166675}, "metadata": {"xai": {"reasoningEncryptedContent": "", "itemId": "rs_8fb146b1-6e2f-958b-ad2f-cd168a5410f4"}}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6da7a95001FKkxCyBcHHqCb7", "message_id": "msg_0b6da68330016v2adL4PvBOPZl", "time_created": 1789774166678, "time_updated": 1789774180222, "data": {"type": "text", "text": "The 33-day slice was a **codebook seed**, not the analysis window. The literature still fits 3–4 months; the **unit of analysis** does not change.\n\n## What “how interaction actually works” is\n\nNot “what they talked about.” The character is the **turn loop**, not the LLM:\n\ninbound → `person_id` / register → idle mood already moved → pre-LLM packet (lock, place, circadian) → mouth → `[IMG:]` / length transform → writeback.\n\nA working analysis answers: **given this cue + this state, what did the mouth do, and did state change?**\n\nThat is why embeddings/classifiers on raw text miss the mechanism. SBERT clusters topical similarity (hardware, sister, sex). Interaction is **situation × register × lock**. Same words, different mouth: insult → `absorb_vent`; “be nice” → anger. AFS in Reimers: unsupervised embeddings fail when similarity is claim+reasoning, not paraphrase.\n\nGrok’s job is the same as Hila’s **deductive coder**: apply a codebook of those situations to episodes, with state attached. Not summarize four months of chat.\n\n## 33 days vs 3–4 months\n\n| Window | Job | Literature analog |\n|---|---|---|\n| First ~month (the 33-day example) | Name the mechanics. Freeze 14 situations. Human-gold a few full turns each. | Marathe & Toyama: automate **after** codebook + a coded subset. Hila: ChatGPT zero-shot κ=0.46 until you scaffold. |\n| Next 2–3 months | **Replay** the codebook. Did protest still fire after 5h? Did cover hold when `sister` is in the thread? Did recall die across days? Did GLM vs deepseek only change diction? | Hila step-by-step + codebook (κ≈0.74) to **label candidates**. Embeddings to **retrieve** “more like this gold episode.” Zheng/G-Eval judge **new mouth vs gold reference**, not a vibe score. |\n\nYou do **not** gold every turn for 3–4 months. You catalog episodes for the whole window, then keep **full aliased gold** only where it proves a mechanic (3–5 turns per situation, spread across months so it is not one week’s model).\n\nScale makes embeddings useful. It does not make them the spec. Zheng’s verbosity bias gets worse on a long corpus: a judge will prefer long helper replies unless the rubric is “match this short gold turn.”\n\n## Data you actually have\n\nGateway export in stats: **2026-06-29 → 2026-08-11** (~6 weeks), 12 Telegram DMs. That is not 3–4 months.\n\nTo do 3–4 months you need a longer memories/gateway export (or more than this dump). Analysis method stays: filter to human DMs, split episodes on gap/register/vent/identity, join pre-LLM state, codebook, then Grok+human on anonymized episodes.\n\nWithout joining **transcript + mood/lock/register**, you only get literary close-reading of the mouth. That is not how the character works. The interaction is pipeline → mouth → human → pipeline.", "time": {"start": 1789774166678, "end": 1789774180221}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6dab10f00