5646, "time_updated": 1789774425883, "data": {"type": "tool", "tool": "read", "callID": "call-8c706531-64c2-4af6-9df6-b62bf326e095-102", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"filePath": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder\\docs\\06-behavior-set.md", "offset": 19, "limit": 16}, "output": "<path>D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder\\docs\\06-behavior-set.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n19: \n20: 12 Telegram DMs: 9 in July, 3 in August (newest `2026-08-04`).\n21: \n22: | | July | August |\n23: |---|---|---|\n24: | Assistant rows | 9456 | 725 |\n25: | `[IMG:]` rate | 46% | 90% |\n26: | Reasoning present | 46% | 54% |\n27: | Assistant median chars | 160 | 344 |\n28: | Dominant line bucket | 5–8 | 5–8, then 9+ |\n29: | `mood` mentions | 381 | 5 |\n30: | `I'm not` | 599 | 76 |\n31: | Tools | heavy (`terminal`, code, browser) | light (`terminal`, files) |\n32: \n33: Newest mouth is more image-cadence, longer, less engine-meta, fewer host-debug tools. July DMs mix relationship talk with live runtime surgery — do not treat that mix as product-default.\n34: \n\n(Showing lines 19-34 of 131. Use offset=35 to continue.)\n</content>", "metadata": {"preview": "\n12 Telegram DMs: 9 in July, 3 in August (newest `2026-08-04`).\n\n| | July | August |\n|---|---|---|\n| Assistant rows | 9456 | 725 |\n| `[IMG:]` rate | 46% | 90% |\n| Reasoning present | 46% | 54% |\n| Assistant median chars | 160 | 344 |\n| Dominant line bucket | 5–8 | 5–8, then 9+ |\n| `mood` mentions | 381 | 5 |\n| `I'm not` | 599 | 76 |\n| Tools | heavy (`terminal`, code, browser) | light (`terminal`, files) |\n\nNewest mouth is more image-cadence, longer, less engine-meta, fewer host-debug tools. July DMs mix relationship talk with live runtime surgery — do not treat that mix as product-default.\n", "truncated": true, "loaded": [], "display": {"type": "file", "path": "D:\\claude\\hades\\hades-product\\.kilo\\worktrees\\separate-binder\\docs\\06-behavior-set.md", "text": "\n12 Telegram DMs: 9 in July, 3 in August (newest `2026-08-04`).\n\n| | July | August |\n|---|---|---|\n| Assistant rows | 9456 | 725 |\n| `[IMG:]` rate | 46% | 90% |\n| Reasoning present | 46% | 54% |\n| Assistant median chars | 160 | 344 |\n| Dominant line bucket | 5–8 | 5–8, then 9+ |\n| `mood` mentions | 381 | 5 |\n| `I'm not` | 599 | 76 |\n| Tools | heavy (`terminal`, code, browser) | light (`terminal`, files) |\n\nNewest mouth is more image-cadence, longer, less engine-meta, fewer host-debug tools. July DMs mix relationship talk with live runtime surgery — do not treat that mix as product-default.\n", "lineStart": 19, "lineEnd": 34, "totalLines": 131, "truncated": true}, "approval": {"source": "agent", "agent": "ask", "rule": {"permission": "read", "pattern": "*", "action": "allow"}}}, "title": "docs\\06-behavior-set.md", "time": {"start": 1789774425733, "end": 1789774425881}}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6de70d9001oq34KXBEOXijzv", "message_id": "msg_0b6de1365001lKbU6a4hcHoy6s", "time_created": 1789774426329, "time_updated": 1789774426330, "data": {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "441a82ad8d7129e87169b83330aaeec6f66cf4b8", "type": "step-finish", "time": {"start": 1789774411534, "end": 1789774426328, "elapsed": 14794}, "metrics": {"generation": 58.06408003244559, "source": "computed"}, "tokens": {"total": 226756, "input": 3817, "output": 92, "reasoning": 767, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 222080}}, "cost": 0.247656}}, {"id": "prt_0b6de7b0c001IUuQGE3clEO4zI", "message_id": "msg_0b6de725f0013sbroXWvoeC0s0", "time_created": 1789774428941, "time_updated": 1789774428943, "data": {"snapshot": "441a82ad8d7129e87169b83330aaeec6f66cf4b8", "type": "step-start", "time": {"start": 1789774428940}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6de7b14001g9vUBtZUJ8vRXD", "message_id": "msg_0b6de725f0013sbroXWvoeC0s0", "time_created": 1789774428948, "time_updated": 1789774430844, "data": {"type": "reasoning", "text": "I have enough. Write a clear technical answer.\n", "time": {"start": 1789774428948, "end": 1789774430843}, "metadata": {"xai": {"reasoningEncryptedContent": "", "itemId": "rs_7a79078f-846d-9bc4-9d1e-50a46f5c5354"}}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6de827f001dTf3etnNYimGDP", "message_id": "msg_0b6de725f0013sbroXWvoeC0s0", "time_created": 1789774430847, "time_updated": 1789774449361, "data": {"type": "text", "text": "Yes — but **not by reading today’s `relations.yaml` back onto July chats.** That is the bug. Current state is not as-of state.\n\n## What “bitemporal” means here\n\nTwo clocks per episode:\n\n| Clock | Meaning | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Valid time** | When the turn happened | `messages.timestamp` 2026-07-04 |\n| **System-as-of** | Pipeline + track that produced the mouth | lock code, pre-LLM packet, `attachment_depth`, model |\n\nA July 4 DM is **not** a September character. Modules, pre-LLM, and depth **now** are a different person-shaped system. Gold and analysis must be labeled with **both**.\n\nClassic failure: join `relations.yaml` (`interaction_count` 2945, `last_contact` 2026-08-20) to a 2026-07-02 session. That leaks the future into the past.\n\n## What is actually on disk\n\n**Per-turn (usable as valid time)**  \nMessage: `timestamp`, `session_id`, `role`, tools — **no mood, lock, register, pipeline SHA**.  \nSession: `started_at`, `model`, `source`, `chat_type`. Model is the only pipeline-ish field that travels with the chat.\n\n**Sparse as-of state**  \n`conversation_log.json`: mood snapshots **2026-06-25 → 2026-07-02** only (`interaction_count` ~807–808). After that, no per-turn packet.\n\n**Current overlay (do not use as history)**  \n`relations.yaml`, `identity_state.json` (`last_tick` 2026-07-10 vs last contact Aug 20 — already inconsistent), live pre-LLM plugin. These are **now**.\n\n**Coarse eras, not a timeline**  \n`SKILLS_CHANGELOG.md` stops **2026-06-22** (before most DMs). MANIFEST consolidation ~Jul 11. Docs already split **July vs August mouth** (`06-behavior-set.md`). Gateway dump ends **Aug 11**; contact in relations continues to **Aug 20**.\n\nThere is **no bitemporal store**. You cannot reconstruct the exact pre-LLM block for a July 15 turn.\n\n## What you can actually do now\n\n1. **Era-bin the 12 DMs** (valid time + model), never current YAML.  \n   Example bins: pre-Jul-10 / Jul-10–Jul-15 / late July / Aug 3–4. `sessions.model` already shows deepseek → glm → aux inside the same DM thread.\n\n2. **Treat July vs August counts as mouth-era evidence**, not as “she got nicer.” August is longer, more `[IMG:]`, fewer `mood` leaks, fewer tools. That can be lock, model, or mix. You cannot attribute without as-of pipeline.\n\n3. **Use `conversation_log` only for Jun 25–Jul 2** if you need mood↔mouth. After Jul 2, do not invent mood from today’s files.\n\n4. **Git of the memories/runtime tree as a second axis** (if history exists on the host). Checkout **as-of session date**, not HEAD, when reading pre-LLM. Still approximate (deploys ≠ commits).\n\n5. **Do not gold “the character.”** Gold **(episode, era)**. Same situation `protest_absence` in early July vs August is two fixtures if lock/model/depth changed.\n\n6. **Product going forward:** append-only turn receipt:\n\n```text\nvalid_time, recorded_at,\npipeline_sha, model,\nregister, tier,\nmood/ITD/fatigue/circadian,\nattachment_depth, interaction_count,\nsession_id\n```\n\nOverwrite is forbidden. That is real bitemporality. Without it, later analysis cannot be done on new data either.\n\n## What you cannot do\n\n- Replay September pre-LLM on July text and call it “how she worked.”  \n- Infer historical depth from 2945.  \n- Cluster 149k rows and read module evolution out of embeddings. Embeddings have no valid-time of the pipeline.  \n- Fill the Jun 29–Aug 11 gap with thoughts from Sep 17–18.\n\n**Practical ceiling on this export:** dated, model-tagged **episode catalog** + full aliased gold **per era**. That is enough to productize “don’t become a helper” and “sister doesn’t leak partner” **as of each era**. It is not enough to write a causal history of every module change. For that you need turn receipts or a new gateway export that already stored the packet.", "time": {"start": 1789774430847, "end": 1789774449359}}}, {"id": "prt_0b6decc4c001aEPdOKxqG2Wpkh", "message_id": "msg_0b6de725f0013sbroXWvoeC0s0", "time_created": 1789774449740, "time_updated": 1789774449740, "data": {"reason": "stop", "snapshot": "441a82ad8d7129e87169b83330aaeec6f66cf4b8", "type": "step-finish", "time": {"start": 1789774428940, "end": 1789774449739, "elapsed": 20798}, "metrics": {"generation": 53.08202711799211, "source": "computed"}, "tokens": {"total": 228382, "input": 1486, "output": 1001, "reasoning": 103, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 225792}}, "cost": 0.244984}}, {"id": "prt_0b6dfa4ea001FVIkK9VtBM66aG", "message_id": "msg_0b6dfa4b3001mFJINXmfMb6Ct6", "time_created": 1789774505198, "time_updated": 1789774505199, "data": {"type": "text", "text": "are u sure its just 33 days? the conversation and transcript should be aa lot lot more,? also why is ur python aka these The user has specified a rule which prevents you from using this specific tool call. Here are some of the relevant rules [{\"permission\":\"*\",\"action\":\"allow\",\"pattern\":\"*\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"*\",\"action\":\"ask\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"touch *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"mkdir *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"cp *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"mv *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"tsc *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"tsgo *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"tar *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"unzip *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"gzip *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"gunzip *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"pe